,{"severity":"low","file":"src/core/pipeline/types.ts","title":"SPEC_FIXER approved → TEST_MATERIALIZE when specFixerObservationForward が TEST_MATERIALIZE 削除スコープ内","rationale":"この行も TEST_MATERIALIZE 行に該当し削除対象。廃止後は SPEC_FIXER approved → IMPLEMENTER when specFixerObservationForward となり、types.ts:271 の exempt-only 行と統合される。acceptance criteria の TEST_MATERIALIZE 行が存在しない でカバーされているが、routing logic 変化として design で明示すると実装ミスを防げる。","line":273}]},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-15T11:29:34.509Z","endedAt":"2026-08-15T11:36:26.563Z","commitOid":"c2e85f748d76d35a60b37f837dc3dcfa6d81a0aa"}
